        "iso_date": "2025-09-03",
        "event": "The controller board of the bakery's only industrial oven failed and the manufacturer agreed to repair it if delivered to its workshop in Birmingham.",
        "fact_ref": "F1"
      },
      {
        "date": "4 September 2025",
        "iso_date": "2025-09-04",
        "event": "The bakery booked SwiftHaul's guaranteed next-day delivery service online for \u00a345, describing the parcel only as 'electronic component' and accepting terms including an exclusion clause.",
